    "title": "Two men involved in Kanawha County drive-by shooting now on probation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By STAFF REPORTS ,\n9 hours ago KANAWHA COUNTY, W.Va. (WCHS) — Two men involved in a drive-by shooting near the Shawnee Sports Complex are now on probation. Anthonio Jacobs and Zion Clark previously pleaded guilty to charges related to the 2024 shooting on Smoot Avenue near the sports complex where a youth sporting event was underway. No one was injured, but the incident resulted in the arrest of multiple people. Read full article\n1",
